v10 w110 f440 a-3.0 p.45
[808 High Conga] vt

# v11: TR-808 Claves (Far-Left)
v11 w111 f440 a-4.0 p-.40
[808 Claves] vt

# v12: TR-808 Cowbell (Center-Left)
v12 w112 f440 a-3.5 p-.15
[808 Cowbell] vt

# v13: TR-808 Maracas (Far-Right)
v13 w113 f440 a-6.5 p.50
[808 Maracas] vt

# v14: TR-808 Crash Cymbal (Left)
v14 w114 f440 a-4.0 p-.60
[808 Crash] vt

# v15: Analog Ride Cymbal (Right)
v15 w115 f440 a-4.0 p.60
[Analog Ride] vt

# v16: Simmons SDS-V Disco Tom (Center-Right)
v16 w116 f440 a-2.0 p.10
[Simmons Tom] vt

# v17: Space Laser Zap (Center-Left)
v17 w117 f440 a-3.5 p-.25
[Space Laser] vt

